{
  "id": "61fe33cd2745de001fdd77c1",
  "title": "画像を並べて表示する記法",
  "created": 1644049360,
  "updated": 1793622668,
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "61fe33cd2745de001fdd77c1",
      "text": "画像を並べて表示する記法",
      "userId": "60fb0a79f3364000237838e3",
      "created": 1644049360,
      "updated": 1644049360
    },
    {
      "id": "6a92bcf2000000000080b756",
      "text": "[UserCSS.icon] [記法UserCSS.icon]",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1788001522,
      "updated": 1788001552
    },
    {
      "id": "6a92bd0f000000000080b757",
      "text": "書式：`[| ...]`",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1788001552,
      "updated": 1788001567
    },
    {
      "id": "6a92bd0f000000000080b758",
      "text": "記号：|",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1788001552,
      "updated": 1788001560
    },
    {
      "id": "6a92bd0f000000000080b759",
      "text": "製作者：[Mijikko.icon] オリジナルは[/scrasobox/madobe.icon]",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1788001552,
      "updated": 1788001653
    },
    {
      "id": "6a92bd0f000000000080b75a",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1788001552,
      "updated": 1788001552
    },
    {
      "id": "61fe79807838e30000a0ba9e",
      "text": "[*****| [https://i.gyazo.com/da78df293f9e83a74b5402411e2f2e01.png][https://i.gyazo.com/da78df293f9e83a74b5402411e2f2e01.png][https://i.gyazo.com/da78df293f9e83a74b5402411e2f2e01.png][https://i.gyazo.com/da78df293f9e83a74b5402411e2f2e01.png][https://i.gyazo.com/da78df293f9e83a74b5402411e2f2e01.png]]",
      "userId": "566fa156776c9b11008ee92a",
      "created": 1644067200,
      "updated": 1644075490
    },
    {
      "id": "61fe79a17838e30000a0baa1",
      "text": "文字にも使える",
      "userId": "60fb0a79f3364000237838e3",
      "created": 1644067232,
      "updated": 1644067236
    },
    {
      "id": "61fe79a57838e30000a0baa2",
      "text": "\t[*****| 1234567890]",
      "userId": "60fb0a79f3364000237838e3",
      "created": 1644067236,
      "updated": 1644067956
    },
    {
      "id": "61fe79847838e30000a0baa0",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "60fb0a79f3364000237838e3",
      "created": 1644067203,
      "updated": 1644067203
    },
    {
      "id": "61fe33d17838e300007c5b9d",
      "text": "from [Settings]",
      "userId": "60fb0a79f3364000237838e3",
      "created": 1644049360,
      "updated": 1644049363
    },
    {
      "id": "61fe33d57838e300007c5b9f",
      "text": "[/scrasobox/画像を並べて表示#5a18bf6396b90400007eff1c]",
      "userId": "60fb0a79f3364000237838e3",
      "created": 1644049365,
      "updated": 1644049402
    },
    {
      "id": "61fe33fa7838e300007c5ba0",
      "text": " 使い方：",
      "userId": "60fb0a79f3364000237838e3",
      "created": 1644049402,
      "updated": 1644049402
    },
    {
      "id": "61fe33fa7838e300007c5ba1",
      "text": " \t一行に敷き詰め: `[| [画像URL][画像URL][画像URL]…]`",
      "userId": "60fb0a79f3364000237838e3",
      "created": 1644049402,
      "updated": 1644049402
    },
    {
      "id": "61fe33fa7838e300007c5ba2",
      "text": " \t横幅いっぱい1列並べ: `[*| [画像URL][画像URL][画像URL]…]`",
      "userId": "60fb0a79f3364000237838e3",
      "created": 1644049402,
      "updated": 1644049402
    },
    {
      "id": "61fe33fa7838e300007c5ba3",
      "text": " \t3列並べ : `[***| [画像URL][画像URL][画像URL]…]`",
      "userId": "60fb0a79f3364000237838e3",
      "created": 1644049402,
      "updated": 1644049402
    },
    {
      "id": "61fe33fa7838e300007c5ba4",
      "text": " \t5列並べ:  `[*****| [画像URL][画像URL][画像URL]…]`",
      "userId": "60fb0a79f3364000237838e3",
      "created": 1644049402,
      "updated": 1644049402
    },
    {
      "id": "61fe33fa7838e300007c5ba5",
      "text": " 最後の2行を有効にした場合、通常ならエディタの横幅を超える複数の画像を1行に敷き詰めて表示すると、下に余白？ができてしまう問題",
      "userId": "60fb0a79f3364000237838e3",
      "created": 1644049402,
      "updated": 1644049402
    },
    {
      "id": "61fe33fa7838e300007c5ba6",
      "text": "  [https://gyazo.com/95e93165eb8f0142722d360bbfd10b1c]",
      "userId": "60fb0a79f3364000237838e3",
      "created": 1644049402,
      "updated": 1644049402
    },
    {
      "id": "61fe33fa7838e300007c5ba7",
      "text": "  でも本家ではなっていなさそう、、なぜだろう",
      "userId": "60fb0a79f3364000237838e3",
      "created": 1644049402,
      "updated": 1644049402
    },
    {
      "id": "61fe33fa7838e300007c5ba8",
      "text": "code:style.css",
      "userId": "60fb0a79f3364000237838e3",
      "created": 1644049402,
      "updated": 1644049402
    },
    {
      "id": "61fe33fa7838e300007c5ba9",
      "text": "\t /* マトリクス記法 */",
      "userId": "60fb0a79f3364000237838e3",
      "created": 1644049402,
      "updated": 1644049402
    },
    {
      "id": "61fe33fa7838e300007c5baa",
      "text": "  .line:not(.cursor-line) .deco-\\| { display: inline-flex }",
      "userId": "60fb0a79f3364000237838e3",
      "created": 1644049402,
      "updated": 1644049402
    },
    {
      "id": "61fe33fa7838e300007c5bab",
      "text": "  .line .deco-\\| img.image { object-fit: contain; margin: 0 }",
      "userId": "60fb0a79f3364000237838e3",
      "created": 1644049402,
      "updated": 1644049402
    },
    {
      "id": "61fe33fa7838e300007c5bac",
      "text": "  ",
      "userId": "60fb0a79f3364000237838e3",
      "created": 1644049402,
      "updated": 1644049402
    },
    {
      "id": "61fe33fa7838e300007c5bad",
      "text": "  /* 太字記法と組み合わせて列数を変える */",
      "userId": "60fb0a79f3364000237838e3",
      "created": 1644049402,
      "updated": 1644049402
    },
    {
      "id": "61fe33fa7838e300007c5bae",
      "text": "  .line .level[class^=\"level\"] .deco-\\| { flex-wrap: wrap }",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1644049402,
      "updated": 1793614711
    },
    {
      "id": "61fe33fa7838e300007c5baf",
      "text": "  .line .level-1 .deco-\\|:not(.deco-\\+) > span { width: calc(100%/1) }",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1644049402,
      "updated": 1793615175
    },
    {
      "id": "61fe33fa7838e300007c5bb0",
      "text": "  .line .level-2 .deco-\\|:not(.deco-\\+) > span { width: calc(100%/2) }",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1644049402,
      "updated": 1793615178
    },
    {
      "id": "61fe33fa7838e300007c5bb1",
      "text": "  .line .level-3 .deco-\\|:not(.deco-\\+) > span { width: calc(100%/3) }",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1644049402,
      "updated": 1793615182
    },
    {
      "id": "61fe33fa7838e300007c5bb2",
      "text": "  .line .level-4 .deco-\\|:not(.deco-\\+) > span { width: calc(100%/4) }",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1644049402,
      "updated": 1793615184
    },
    {
      "id": "61fe78aa7838e30000951d28",
      "text": "  .line .level-5 .deco-\\|:not(.deco-\\+) > span { width: calc(100%/5) }",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1644066986,
      "updated": 1793615186
    },
    {
      "id": "61fe78aa7838e30000951d29",
      "text": "  .line .level-6 .deco-\\|:not(.deco-\\+) > span { width: calc(100%/6) }",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1644066986,
      "updated": 1793615187
    },
    {
      "id": "61fe78ee7838e3000093ec57",
      "text": "  .line .level-7 .deco-\\|:not(.deco-\\+) > span { width: calc(100%/7) }",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1644067054,
      "updated": 1793615189
    },
    {
      "id": "61fe78ee7838e3000093ec58",
      "text": "  .line .level-8 .deco-\\|:not(.deco-\\+) > span { width: calc(100%/8) }",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1644067054,
      "updated": 1793615189
    },
    {
      "id": "61fe78ee7838e3000093ec59",
      "text": "  .line .level-9 .deco-\\|:not(.deco-\\+) > span { width: calc(100%/9) }",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1644067054,
      "updated": 1793615191
    },
    {
      "id": "61fe78ef7838e3000093ec5a",
      "text": "  .line .level-10 .deco-\\|:not(.deco-\\+) > span { width: calc(100%/10) }",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1644067054,
      "updated": 1793615192
    },
    {
      "id": "61fe33fa7838e300007c5bb4",
      "text": "  ",
      "userId": "60fb0a79f3364000237838e3",
      "created": 1644049402,
      "updated": 1644049402
    },
    {
      "id": "61fe33fa7838e300007c5bb5",
      "text": "  .line .level[class^=\"level\"] .deco-\\| img.image { object-fit: cover; width: 100%; height: 100% }",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1644049402,
      "updated": 1793615218
    },
    {
      "id": "61fe33fa7838e300007c5bb6",
      "text": "  ",
      "userId": "60fb0a79f3364000237838e3",
      "created": 1644049402,
      "updated": 1644049402
    },
    {
      "id": "61fe33fa7838e300007c5bb7",
      "text": "  /* 並べた画像の間にスキマが欲しい場合はこの2行を追加・ぴっちり敷き詰めたい場合はこの2行は不要 */",
      "userId": "60fb0a79f3364000237838e3",
      "created": 1644049402,
      "updated": 1644049402
    },
    {
      "id": "61fe33fa7838e300007c5bb8",
      "text": "  .line .deco-\\| > span,",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1644049402,
      "updated": 1793616196
    },
    {
      "id": "6ae8694400000000009016cc",
      "text": "  .line .level[class^=\"level\"] .deco-\\| > span { overflow: hidden }",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1793616196,
      "updated": 1793616196
    },
    {
      "id": "61fe33fa7838e300007c5bb9",
      "text": "  .line .deco-\\| img.image,",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1644049402,
      "updated": 1793615237
    },
    {
      "id": "6ae865840000000000426bbe",
      "text": "  .line .level[class^=\"level\"] .deco-\\| img.image { margin: .2em }",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1793615237,
      "updated": 1793615237
    },
    {
      "id": "61fe776f7838e300003556df",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "60fb0a79f3364000237838e3",
      "created": 1644066670,
      "updated": 1644066676
    },
    {
      "id": "61fe80327838e300000e2f2c",
      "text": "\t文字サイズ固定化[Mijikko.icon]",
      "userId": "60fb0a79f3364000237838e3",
      "created": 1644068913,
      "updated": 1644068917
    },
    {
      "id": "61fe801e7838e300000e2f2b",
      "text": "\t\t`[* ]`と`[| ]`を併用時に文字サイズを大きくする必要はないと思うので",
      "userId": "60fb0a79f3364000237838e3",
      "created": 1644068894,
      "updated": 1644068955
    },
    {
      "id": "61fe78be7838e30000b7b4ba",
      "text": "code:style.css",
      "userId": "60fb0a79f3364000237838e3",
      "created": 1644067006,
      "updated": 1644067009
    },
    {
      "id": "61fe78c37838e30000b7b4bb",
      "text": " .line .deco-\\|.deco-\\* > span{ font-size: 15px; line-height: 15px;}",
      "userId": "60fb0a79f3364000237838e3",
      "created": 1644067010,
      "updated": 1644067710
    },
    {
      "id": "61fe76d17838e300003556de",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "60fb0a79f3364000237838e3",
      "created": 1644066512,
      "updated": 1644067097
    },
    {
      "id": "61fe33d17838e300007c5b9e",
      "text": "　もう公式で対応してしまったので、新しく使うことはない？[yosider.icon]",
      "userId": "5c30ba88e98efe0017e5172d",
      "created": 1644049361,
      "updated": 1644085315
    },
    {
      "id": "61fec055e5172d0000ad672f",
      "text": "　　n列並べとかは一応あるか",
      "userId": "5c30ba88e98efe0017e5172d",
      "created": 1644085333,
      "updated": 1644085363
    },
    {
      "id": "61fec028e5172d0000ad672e",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "5c30ba88e98efe0017e5172d",
      "created": 1644085288,
      "updated": 1644085288
    },
    {
      "id": "69e30475000000000001874f",
      "text": "これ要るだろうか？（2人目）[Summer498.icon]",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1776485493,
      "updated": 1776485513
    },
    {
      "id": "69e3048c0000000000018751",
      "text": "\t[***| 123456789*0#]",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1776485516,
      "updated": 1776485580
    },
    {
      "id": "69e304a40000000000018752",
      "text": "\tこの使い道があるか。（同じ結論）",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1776485540,
      "updated": 1776485552
    },
    {
      "id": "69e304750000000000018750",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1776485493,
      "updated": 1776485493
    },
    {
      "id": "6ae863410000000000426b99",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1793614657,
      "updated": 1793614657
    },
    {
      "id": "6ae863280000000000426b95",
      "text": "[** 縦幅を変える記法]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1793614632,
      "updated": 1793614655
    },
    {
      "id": "6ae864f10000000000426bbd",
      "text": "書式：`[|+ ]` ([|][+])",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1793615090,
      "updated": 1793615402
    },
    {
      "id": "6ae8659e0000000000426bbf",
      "text": "例：",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1793615262,
      "updated": 1793616163
    },
    {
      "id": "6ae8692200000000009016cb",
      "text": "\t[|+***** 1234567890]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1793616163,
      "updated": 1793616163
    },
    {
      "id": "6ae8692100000000009016ca",
      "text": "\t[*****|+ [https://i.gyazo.com/da78df293f9e83a74b5402411e2f2e01.png][https://i.gyazo.com/da78df293f9e83a74b5402411e2f2e01.png][https://i.gyazo.com/da78df293f9e83a74b5402411e2f2e01.png][https://i.gyazo.com/da78df293f9e83a74b5402411e2f2e01.png][https://i.gyazo.com/da78df293f9e83a74b5402411e2f2e01.png]]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1793616161,
      "updated": 1793616170
    },
    {
      "id": "6ae863380000000000426b98",
      "text": "code:style.css",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1793614648,
      "updated": 1793615373
    },
    {
      "id": "6ae863f50000000000426bb2",
      "text": "  .deco-\\+ > span:not([class]):is(.deco-\\| > *) {",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1793614837,
      "updated": 1793615865
    },
    {
      "id": "6ae86c780000000000d82138",
      "text": "  \tdisplay: block;\tmax-height: 300px;",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1793617016,
      "updated": 1793620389
    },
    {
      "id": "6ae87a1b0000000000a485f6",
      "text": "  \t.line .level-1 & { max-height: calc(300px * 3/4) }",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1793620507,
      "updated": 1793622655
    },
    {
      "id": "6ae87a1b0000000000a485f7",
      "text": "  \t.line .level-2 & { max-height: calc(300px/2) }",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1793620507,
      "updated": 1793622658
    },
    {
      "id": "6ae87a1b0000000000a485f8",
      "text": " \t.line .level-3 & { max-height: calc(300px/3) }",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1793620507,
      "updated": 1793622660
    },
    {
      "id": "6ae87a1b0000000000a485f9",
      "text": "  \t.line .level-4 & { max-height: calc(300px/4) }",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1793620507,
      "updated": 1793622661
    },
    {
      "id": "6ae87a1b0000000000a485fa",
      "text": "  \t.line .level-5 & { max-height: calc(300px/5) }",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1793620507,
      "updated": 1793622662
    },
    {
      "id": "6ae87a1b0000000000a485fb",
      "text": " \t.line .level-6 & { max-height: calc(300px/6) }",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1793620507,
      "updated": 1793622663
    },
    {
      "id": "6ae87a1b0000000000a485fc",
      "text": " \t.line .level-7 & { max-height: calc(300px/7) }",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1793620507,
      "updated": 1793622664
    },
    {
      "id": "6ae87a1b0000000000a485fd",
      "text": " \t.line .level-8 & { max-height: calc(300px/8) }",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1793620507,
      "updated": 1793622665
    },
    {
      "id": "6ae87a1b0000000000a485fe",
      "text": "  \t.line .level-9 & { max-height: calc(300px/9) }",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1793620507,
      "updated": 1793622667
    },
    {
      "id": "6ae87a1b0000000000a485ff",
      "text": "  \t.line .level-10 & { max-height: calc(300px/10) }",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1793620507,
      "updated": 1793622668
    },
    {
      "id": "6ae864060000000000426bbc",
      "text": "  }",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1793614854,
      "updated": 1793615084
    },
    {
